Structure point:
    Field x as integer.
    Field y as integer.
End structure.
Union number:
    Field whole as integer.
    Field bits as unsigned integer.
End union.
Structure shape:
    Field id as integer.
    Anonymous field as structure point.
    Anonymous field as union number.
End structure.
Declare s as structure shape.
Set member id of s to 1.
Set member x of s to 10.
Set member y of s to 20.
Set member whole of s to 7.
Say Member id of s.
Say Member x of s plus Member y of s.
Say Member bits of s.
